#: manual/about.md:3
msgid "This collection gathers the *Probably Stolen* mods written by KCN-judu. Every mod lives in its own repository, with its own releases and Steam Workshop page; the collection repository ties them together as Git submodules and builds this site from their documentation."
msgstr "这个合集收录 KCN-judu 为《深空当铺：可能是偷的》（*Probably Stolen*）制作的模组。每个模组都有自己的仓库、发布版本和 Steam 创意工坊页面；合集仓库以 Git 子模块把它们组织在一起，并用它们的文档生成本站。"

#: manual/about.md:5
#: manual/contribute/documentation_standard.md:5
msgid "Principles"
msgstr "原则"

#: manual/about.md:7
msgid "**Keep the game's rules.** A mod may remove waiting, guessing or wasted work, but customers accept what they accepted before, locks still lock, and saves load as they did. Where a mod changes how something is computed, it computes the same answer."
msgstr "**不改游戏规则。** 模组可以去掉等待、猜测和无用的计算，但顾客收什么照旧，锁住的东西照样锁着，存档照常读取。模组改变了某个计算方式的地方，算出来的结果也完全一样。"

#: manual/about.md:9
msgid "**Ask for nothing.** Every mod declares no capabilities, so the game enables it without a permission prompt. Reflection only names game types directly, which the game's mod scanner accepts."
msgstr "**不要任何权限。** 每个模组都不声明任何权限，游戏启用它时不会弹出权限确认。反射只直接引用游戏的类型，游戏的模组扫描器认可这种写法。"

#: manual/about.md:11
msgid "**Fail quietly.** A patch that cannot attach, after a game update for example, turns its own feature off and writes one line to `Player.log`. It never stops the rest of the mod or the game."
msgstr "**出错也不打扰。** 某个补丁挂不上时（比如游戏更新之后），只关掉它自己的功能，并在 `Player.log` 里写一行说明，绝不影响模组的其他部分，更不会影响游戏。"

#: manual/about.md:13
msgid "**Measure first.** Performance work starts from the game's own log and from a profiler, not from guesses. The numbers behind each fix are in its documentation."
msgstr "**先测量再优化。** 性能优化从游戏自己的日志和分析器出发，而不是靠猜。每项修复背后的数据都写在它的文档里。"

