msgstr "性能修复"

#: manual/about.md:22
msgid "Removes stutters with large, packed storage."
msgstr "消除大型满载仓库带来的卡顿。"

#: manual/about.md:24
msgid "Look"
msgstr "外观"

#: manual/about.md:26
msgid "The site and the mod covers share one design: the game's dusk-violet windows, cream text and teal title bars, square panels with a one-pixel bevel, and pixel lettering for names and labels. The cover system is described in `design/DESIGN.md` of the collection repository. Chinese headings use Cubic 11, an open-source pixel font released under the SIL Open Font License."
msgstr "本站和模组封面采用同一套设计：游戏的暮紫色窗口、奶油色文字和青色标题栏，带一像素斜面的方形面板，名称和标签使用像素字体。封面设计规范写在合集仓库的 `design/DESIGN.md` 中。中文标题使用以 SIL Open Font License 发布的开源像素字体俐方体 11 号。"

#: manual/about.md:28
msgid "License"
msgstr "许可证"

#: manual/about.md:30
msgid "Every repository is released under the Apache License 2.0. *Probably Stolen* and its assets belong to their owners; no game files are distributed here."
msgstr "所有仓库均以 Apache License 2.0 发布。《深空当铺：可能是偷的》及其素材归其所有者所有，这里不分发任何游戏文件。"

#: manual/contribute/documentation_standard.md:1
msgid "Documentation standard"
msgstr "文档规范"

#: manual/contribute/documentation_standard.md:3
msgid "This standard applies to every mod in the collection. It fixes where documentation lives, how it is divided into pages, and which source is authoritative."
msgstr "本规范适用于合集中的每个模组，规定文档放在哪里、如何分页，以及以哪个来源为准。"

#: manual/contribute/documentation_standard.md:7
msgid "**Describe what exists.** Pages document the mod as it is on the current branch: what it does, its options, and the decisions behind them. Plans belong in issues."
msgstr "**描述现有的东西。** 页面记录当前分支上的模组：它做什么、有哪些选项、背后的设计决定。计划写在 issue 里。"

#: manual/contribute/documentation_standard.md:9
msgid "**English is the source.** Pages are written once, in English. Translations are made from that text through [gettext catalogs](translation.md) and are never edited as copies of a page."
msgstr "**英文是源文本。** 页面只用英文编写一次。译文通过 [gettext 翻译目录](translation.md) 从该文本生成，绝不作为页面副本进行编辑。"

#: manual/contribute/documentation_standard.md:11
msgid "**Players first, then modders.** The overview page tells a player what the mod does and how to use it. How it works, measurements and build instructions follow on their own pages."
msgstr "**先玩家，后开发者。** 总览页告诉玩家模组做什么、怎么用。实现方式、测量数据和构建说明放在各自的页面里。"

#: manual/contribute/documentation_standard.md:13
msgid "Repository layout"
msgstr "仓库布局"

#: manual/contribute/documentation_standard.md:29
msgid "Nothing else belongs in `doc/`."
msgstr "`doc/` 里不放其他东西。"

#: manual/contribute/documentation_standard.md:42
msgid "`title` is the mod's name as shown in the library. `summary` is one sentence for the library and the home page; it is translated like any page text. `locales` lists the translations the mod maintains. `order` is the order of the pages in the sidebar."
msgstr "`title` 是模组在列表中显示的名称。`summary` 是用于模组列表和首页的一句话简介，和正文一样会被翻译。`locales` 列出模组维护的翻译。`order` 是页面在侧边栏中的顺序。"

#: manual/contribute/documentation_standard.md:44
msgid "Pages"
msgstr "页面"

#: manual/contribute/documentation_standard.md:46
msgid "Each page starts with one `# Title`, which becomes its title in the sidebar and in search results."
msgstr "每个页面以一行 `# 标题` 开头，它会成为侧边栏和搜索结果中的标题。"

#: manual/contribute/documentation_standard.md:47
msgid "One page, one purpose: an overview, a guide to one part, or the build instructions."
msgstr "一页只做一件事：总览、某一部分的指南，或构建说明。"

#: manual/contribute/documentation_standard.md:48
msgid "Name a game type or method in code formatting, as in `PhoneUIManager.PressNumber`, so a reader can find it in the game."
msgstr "提到游戏的类型或方法时用代码格式，比如 `PhoneUIManager.PressNumber`，方便读者在游戏代码里找到它。"

#: manual/contribute/documentation_standard.md:49
msgid "Numbers that motivate a change, such as a measured stutter, come with how they were measured."
msgstr "促成改动的数据（比如测得的卡顿时长）要附上测量方法。"

#: manual/contribute/index.md:1
msgid "Contributing"
msgstr "参与贡献"

#: manual/contribute/index.md:3
msgid "Each mod keeps its documentation next to its code. Its repository has a `doc/` folder with English pages and translations as gettext catalogs beside them. This site collects every mod on each build, so a change merged into a mod's `main` branch appears here once the collection points at it."
msgstr "每个模组的文档都和代码放在一起：仓库里有一个 `doc/` 目录，存放英文页面，旁边是 gettext 格式的翻译目录。本站每次构建时收集所有模组，所以合入某个模组 `main` 分支的改动，在合集指向该提交后就会出现在这里。"

#: manual/contribute/index.md:5
msgid "The same rules apply to every mod:"
msgstr "所有模组遵循相同的规则："

#: manual/contribute/index.md:7
msgid "[Documentation standard](documentation_standard.md): where files go and what each page contains."
msgstr "[文档规范](documentation_standard.md)：文件放在哪里，以及每个页面包含什么。"

#: manual/contribute/index.md:8
msgid "[Writing and markup](writing.md): headings, code, notes and images."
msgstr "[写作与标记](writing.md)：标题、代码、提示和图片。"

#: manual/contribute/index.md:9
msgid "[Translation](translation.md): how the gettext workflow keeps every language in step with English."
msgstr "[翻译](translation.md)：gettext 工作流程如何让每种语言与英文保持同步。"

#: manual/contribute/index.md:10
msgid "[Modding tools](modding_tools.md): building mods, the scanner check and the game-inspection tools."
msgstr "[模组开发工具](modding_tools.md)：构建模组、扫描器检查和游戏分析工具。"

#: manual/contribute/index.md:12
msgid "Getting the collection"
msgstr "获取合集"

#: manual/contribute/index.md:20
msgid "Commands"
msgstr "命令"

#: manual/contribute/index.md:22
msgid "Run these from the collection repository. Each one covers the site's own pages and every mod in `mods/`:"
msgstr "在合集仓库中运行以下命令。每条命令都会处理本站自己的页面以及 `mods/` 下的每个模组："

#: manual/contribute/index.md:30
msgid "A change to a mod's `doc/manual` must also contain the updated catalogs produced by `update-po`."
msgstr "修改模组的 `doc/manual` 时，必须同时提交 `update-po` 生成的更新后的翻译目录。"

#: manual/contribute/index.md:32
msgid "Previewing the site"
msgstr "预览站点"

#: manual/contribute/index.md:39
msgid "The build reads the mods from `mods/`, so a local preview shows unpublished changes in any of them."
msgstr "构建会从 `mods/` 读取模组，所以本地预览能看到任何模组中尚未发布的改动。"

#: manual/contribute/modding_tools.md:1
msgid "Modding tools"
msgstr "模组开发工具"

#: manual/contribute/modding_tools.md:3
msgid "The collection repository keeps the tools shared by every mod."
msgstr "合集仓库存放所有模组共用的工具。"

#: manual/contribute/modding_tools.md:5
msgid "Building"
msgstr "构建"

#: manual/contribute/modding_tools.md:7
msgid "Each mod builds with its own `build.sh` against the game's assemblies; see the mod's Building page. From the collection, `scripts/build-all.sh` builds every mod, and `scripts/package.sh` collects the built folders into `dist/packages/` with a zip of each."
msgstr "每个模组用自己的 `build.sh` 针对游戏程序集构建，详见各模组的“构建”页。在合集中，`scripts/build-all.sh` 构建全部模组，`scripts/package.sh` 把构建好的文件夹收集到 `dist/packages/`，并为每个模组打一个 zip 包。"

#: manual/contribute/modding_tools.md:9
msgid "The scanner check"
msgstr "扫描器检查"

#: manual/contribute/modding_tools.md:11
msgid "The game scans every mod DLL before enabling it and asks the player for permission when a mod uses files, the network, reflection over unknown types or similar capabilities. Every mod here declares none."
msgstr "游戏在启用模组前会扫描它的 DLL，如果模组使用了文件、网络、对未知类型的反射等能力，就会向玩家请求权限。这里的每个模组都不声明任何权限。"

#: manual/contribute/modding_tools.md:13
msgid "`tools/modding/ScanTest.cs` runs the game's own scanner, `ModScanner.Scan`, on a built mod outside the game:"
msgstr "`tools/modding/ScanTest.cs` 在游戏之外，用游戏自己的扫描器 `ModScanner.Scan` 检查构建好的模组："

#: manual/contribute/modding_tools.md:19
msgid "It prints the capabilities found and any hard flags, such as an attempt to patch the game's mod loader. A mod is ready when it prints `capabilities: none` and no `HARD` line."
msgstr "它会列出检测到的权限和硬性拦截项（比如试图修改游戏的模组加载器）。输出 `capabilities: none` 且没有 `HARD` 行，模组才算合格。"

#: manual/contribute/modding_tools.md:21
msgid "Inspecting the game"
msgstr "分析游戏代码"

#: manual/contribute/modding_tools.md:23
msgid "Small Mono.Cecil programs in `tools/modding/` read the game's `Assembly-CSharp.dll`:"
msgstr "`tools/modding/` 中的几个 Mono.Cecil 小程序用来读取游戏的 `Assembly-CSharp.dll`："

#: manual/contribute/modding_tools.md:25
msgid "Tool"
msgstr "工具"

#: manual/contribute/modding_tools.md:25
msgid "Use"
msgstr "用途"

#: manual/contribute/modding_tools.md:27
msgid "Types, fields and methods matching a pattern, with the IL of chosen methods"
msgstr "列出匹配某个模式的类型、字段和方法，并输出指定方法的 IL"

#: manual/contribute/modding_tools.md:28
msgid "Every method whose IL matches an instruction pattern, such as all callers of a method"
msgstr "找出 IL 匹配某个指令模式的所有方法，比如某个方法的全部调用者"

#: manual/contribute/modding_tools.md:29
msgid "Like Find, with the instructions that follow each match"
msgstr "和 Find 类似，但会附上每处匹配之后的几条指令"

#: manual/contribute/modding_tools.md:30
msgid "The values of constant fields"
msgstr "常量字段的值"

#: manual/contribute/modding_tools.md:32
msgid "They compile with the C# compiler that ships with Windows against the `Unity.Burst.Cecil.dll` the game provides."
msgstr "它们可以用 Windows 自带的 C# 编译器，引用游戏自带的 `Unity.Burst.Cecil.dll` 编译。"

#: manual/contribute/translation.md:1
msgid "Translation"
msgstr "翻译"

#: manual/contribute/translation.md:3
msgid "The collection translates its documentation the way the Blender manual and the Luna Flow documentation do: English pages are the only source, and every other language is a gettext catalog of translated messages. A page in Chinese is generated from the English page and the catalog when the site is built."
msgstr "本合集的文档翻译方式与 Blender 手册和 Luna Flow 文档相同：英文页面是唯一的来源，其他语言都是由已翻译消息组成的 gettext 目录。构建站点时，中文页面由英文页面和翻译目录生成。"

#: manual/contribute/translation.md:5
msgid "This has three consequences:"
msgstr "这带来了三个结果："

#: manual/contribute/translation.md:7
msgid "A language can never fall out of structure with English. Pages, headings, code and links come from one source."
msgstr "任何语言的结构都不会与英文脱节。页面、标题、代码和链接都来自同一个源。"

#: manual/contribute/translation.md:8
msgid "An untranslated or outdated passage is shown in English instead of disappearing or being wrong. The page says how much of it is translated."
msgstr "未翻译或过时的段落会以英文显示，而不会消失或出错。页面会说明其中已翻译的比例。"

#: manual/contribute/translation.md:9
msgid "The site knows the coverage of every page and every mod, and shows it in the library."
msgstr "站点知道每个页面和每个模组的翻译完成度，并在模组列表中显示出来。"

#: manual/contribute/translation.md:11
msgid "Messages"
msgstr "消息"

#: manual/contribute/translation.md:13
msgid "`lunadoc` splits every page into messages: headings, paragraphs, list items, table cells, and the `title` and `description` front matter keys. Code blocks and raw HTML are never messages; they appear in every language exactly as written in English."
msgstr "`lunadoc` 把每个页面拆分成消息：标题、段落、列表项、表格单元格，以及前置元数据中的 `title` 和 `description`。代码块和原始 HTML 不会成为消息，在每种语言里都和英文原文完全一致。"

#: manual/contribute/translation.md:15
msgid "A paragraph that wraps over several lines is one message. Re-wrapping English text does not change its message, so it does not invalidate translations."
msgstr "跨越多行的段落是一条消息。重新折行英文文本不会改变其消息，因此不会使译文失效。"

#: manual/contribute/translation.md:17
msgid "The workflow"
msgstr "工作流程"

#: manual/contribute/translation.md:19
msgid "Edit the English pages in `doc/manual`."
msgstr "在 `doc/manual` 中编辑英文页面。"

#: manual/contribute/translation.md:20
msgid "Run `npm run update-po` in the collection. It regenerates `doc/locale/manual.pot` of every mod and merges it into every `manual.po`."
msgstr "在合集中运行 `npm run update-po`。它会重新生成每个模组的 `doc/locale/manual.pot`，并合并到每个 `manual.po` 中。"

#: manual/contribute/translation.md:21
msgid "Commit the pages and the catalogs together."
msgstr "将页面和翻译目录一起提交。"

#: manual/contribute/translation.md:23
msgid "`update` behaves like GNU `msgmerge`:"
msgstr "`update` 的行为与 GNU `msgmerge` 相同："

#: manual/contribute/translation.md:25
msgid "A message whose English text is unchanged keeps its translation."
msgstr "英文文本未改变的消息保留其译文。"

#: manual/contribute/translation.md:26
msgid "A message whose English text changed takes the translation of the most similar old message and is marked `fuzzy`. The previous English text is kept in a `#| msgid` comment so a translator can see what changed."
msgstr "英文文本发生变化的消息会采用最相似旧消息的译文，并被标记为 `fuzzy`。之前的英文文本保存在 `#| msgid` 注释中，以便译者查看改动。"

#: manual/contribute/translation.md:27
msgid "A translation whose message disappeared is kept as an obsolete entry (`#~`) at the end of the catalog, where `update` can recover it later."
msgstr "消息已消失的译文会作为废弃条目（`#~`）保留在翻译目录末尾，`update` 之后可以从那里恢复它。"

#: manual/contribute/translation.md:29
msgid "Fuzzy translations are not shown on the site. They count as untranslated until a translator reviews them and removes the `fuzzy` flag."
msgstr "fuzzy 译文不会在站点上显示。在译者审阅并移除 `fuzzy` 标记之前，它们都算作未翻译。"

#: manual/contribute/translation.md:31
msgid "Translating"
msgstr "进行翻译"

#: manual/contribute/translation.md:33
msgid "Open `doc/locale/<locale>/LC_MESSAGES/manual.po` in a text editor or a gettext editor such as Poedit, and fill in `msgstr` for each `msgid`:"
msgstr "在文本编辑器或 Poedit 等 gettext 编辑器中打开 `doc/locale/<locale>/LC_MESSAGES/manual.po`，为每个 `msgid` 填写 `msgstr`："

#: manual/contribute/translation.md:41
msgid "When translating:"
msgstr "翻译时："

#: manual/contribute/translation.md:43
msgid "Keep inline code and link destinations exactly as in English. Translate link text."
msgstr "行内代码和链接地址保持与英文完全一致。链接文字需要翻译。"

#: manual/contribute/translation.md:44
msgid "Keep Markdown markup: emphasis, inline code and links must still be balanced."
msgstr "保留 Markdown 标记：强调、行内代码和链接必须保持配对完整。"

#: manual/contribute/translation.md:45
msgid "Keep a GitHub alert marker such as `[!NOTE]` at the start of the message."
msgstr "将 GitHub 提示标记（例如 `[!NOTE]`）保留在消息开头。"

#: manual/contribute/translation.md:46
msgid "Do not translate identifiers, even in prose. Use the game's own Chinese names for items, places and people."
msgstr "不要翻译标识符，即使出现在正文中也一样。物品、地点和人物使用游戏自己的中文名称。"

#: manual/contribute/translation.md:47
msgid "Leave `msgstr` empty rather than guessing. An empty message falls back to English."
msgstr "与其猜测，不如将 `msgstr` 留空。空消息会回退到英文。"

#: manual/contribute/translation.md:49
msgid "Check the result with `npm run status` and preview it with the site."
msgstr "用 `npm run status` 检查结果，再用站点预览。"

#: manual/contribute/translation.md:51
msgid "Locales"
msgstr "语言环境"

#: manual/contribute/translation.md:53
msgid "Locale names follow gettext: `zh_CN` for Simplified Chinese. They appear in `conf.json`, in the catalog paths and in `config/locales.json` of the site, which also gives each locale its URL segment and display name. Adding a language to the site means adding it there; adding it to a repository means listing it in `conf.json` and running `update`."
msgstr "语言区域名称遵循 gettext 规范：简体中文是 `zh_CN`。它出现在 `conf.json`、翻译目录的路径，以及站点的 `config/locales.json` 中；后者还为每种语言指定 URL 路径段和显示名称。给站点添加一种语言，就在那里添加；给某个仓库添加一种语言，就在它的 `conf.json` 中列出并运行 `update`。"

#: manual/contribute/writing.md:1
msgid "Writing and markup"
msgstr "写作与标记"

#: manual/contribute/writing.md:3
msgid "Pages are GitHub-flavoured Markdown. Everything described here also renders on GitHub, so a page read in the repository and the same page on this site say the same thing."
msgstr "页面使用 GitHub 风格的 Markdown 编写。这里描述的所有内容在 GitHub 上同样能够渲染，因此在仓库中阅读的页面与本站上的同一页面内容一致。"

#: manual/contribute/writing.md:5
msgid "Style"
msgstr "风格"

#: manual/contribute/writing.md:7
msgid "Write for a player first: what happens in the game, in the game's own words (customer, counter, storage bay, Workshop)."
msgstr "首先写给玩家看：用游戏自己的说法（顾客、柜台、储物舱、创意工坊）描述游戏里发生了什么。"

#: manual/contribute/writing.md:8
msgid "Short sentences, one fact each. Active voice: \"the mod skips the ringing\", not \"the ringing is skipped\"."
msgstr "句子要短，一句只讲一件事。用主动语态：写“模组跳过拨号音”，而不是“拨号音被跳过”。"

#: manual/contribute/writing.md:9
msgid "Say what something does, not that it is easy, simple or powerful."
msgstr "说明它做什么，而不是说它简单、方便或强大。"

#: manual/contribute/writing.md:11
msgid "Code"
msgstr "代码"

#: manual/contribute/writing.md:13
msgid "Fence shell commands with `sh` or `bash` and C# with `csharp`. Keep examples small and make sure they work."
msgstr "命令行代码块标注 `sh` 或 `bash`，C# 代码标注 `csharp`。示例要短小，并确保能运行。"

#: manual/contribute/writing.md:19
msgid "Tables"
msgstr "表格"

#: manual/contribute/writing.md:21
msgid "Use a table for options and other lists with the same columns. Keep each cell to one sentence; every cell is translated on its own."
msgstr "选项等列数相同的列表用表格呈现。每个单元格只写一句话，因为每个单元格都会单独翻译。"

#: manual/contribute/writing.md:23
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "提示"

#: manual/contribute/writing.md:25
msgid "GitHub alerts render as notes:"
msgstr "GitHub 提示块会显示为提示框："

#: manual/contribute/writing.md:32
msgid "Images"
msgstr "图片"

#: manual/contribute/writing.md:34
msgid "Put images in `doc/attachments/` and link them relatively, with alt text that says what the image shows:"
msgstr "图片放在 `doc/attachments/` 中，用相对路径引用，并写上说明图片内容的替代文字："

#: manual/contribute/writing.md:40
msgid "Pixel art is shown with nearest-neighbour scaling, so draw it at a small size and let the site scale it."
msgstr "像素图以最近邻方式缩放显示，所以按小尺寸绘制，交给站点放大即可。"

#: manual/index.md:8
msgid "Mods for *Probably Stolen* that keep the game's rules and take away what gets in the way: waiting, guessing and stutters. Each one does one thing, works on its own, and needs no special permissions."
msgstr "为《深空当铺：可能是偷的》（*Probably Stolen*）制作的模组：不改游戏规则，只去掉碍事的部分，比如等待、猜测和卡顿。每个模组只做一件事，可以单独使用，也不需要任何特殊权限。"
